        "_comment": "The Game Boy's eight buttons are P1's. P2 to P4 are the Super Game Boy's other controllers and are not live on this machine, nor is Toggle Link Connection. Power turns the console off and on again. P1 Tilt X and Y are a cartridge's tilt sensor (an MBC7 cartridge), live only with one.",
